# MACHINE MAGNETS — COMPLETE VISUAL REDESIGN & FUNCTIONAL IMPLEMENTATION

## MISSION

Redesign the existing Machine Magnets website into a highly polished, immersive, interactive, and production-quality digital experience for the AI/ML club at NIET.

This is a complete visual and interaction redesign of the existing project.

The current implementation is too generic. It relies on oversized headings, repetitive rectangular sections, alternating red and black backgrounds, plain text layouts, basic member blocks, and a simplistic geometric logo.

Do not merely improve the existing styling. Rethink the visual composition, art direction, typography, motion design, interactions, and page structure.

The website must look intentionally designed by a professional creative development team, not generated from a generic website template.

Build a cohesive brand experience inspired by the visual storytelling, event presentation, and immersive technical identity of https://techkriti.org/, while retaining an original identity for Machine Magnets.

Reference the quality and ambition of the experience, not its exact implementation. Do not copy its branding, assets, or layouts.

**Priority order:**
1. Exceptional visual design and art direction.
2. A distinctive opening experience and coordinated animations.
3. Useful, genuinely functional website features.
4. Responsive behavior and accessibility.
5. Performance and maintainability.

All five matter. Do not sacrifice the visual design by concentrating exclusively on implementing sections and buttons.

